  {topic:'bunker',title:'The flag is not always your best aim',text:'If the flag sits beside a bunker, a small miss can leave you in sand. Aim toward the roomier part of the green when that gives your spread a better fit. You may leave a slightly longer putt, but fewer difficult recoveries. Now follow the highlighted target.'}
